### Models

#### [NEW] [models/fair.py](file:///c:/Users/serig/OneDrive/Masaüstü/development/data-instruction-tool/HyperScrape/models/fair.py)

Veri modelleri:

```python
from dataclasses import dataclass, field
from typing import Optional, List

@dataclass
class Company:
    name: str = ""
    website: str = ""
    email: str = ""
    email2: str = ""
    phone: str = ""
    address: str = ""
    city: str = ""
    country: str = ""
    zip_code: str = ""
    products: str = ""
    data_source: str = ""
    
    # Enriched data
    linkedin: str = ""
    facebook: str = ""
    instagram: str = ""
    
@dataclass
class FairConfig:
    name: str
    base_url: str
    pagination: str
    template: str
    selectors: dict = field(default_factory=dict)
    
@dataclass  
class ScrapeResult:
    companies: List[Company]
    total_pages: int
    success_count: int
    error_count: int
    duration_seconds: float
    
    def to_dataframe(self) -> pd.DataFrame:
        return pd.DataFrame([c.__dict__ for c in self.companies])
```

